<h1>Bennett Lawson</h1>
<p>44th Ward alderman, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027. Incumbent.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.bennettfor44.com/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (bennettfor44.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Launched his campaign for a second term in July 2026. His campaign site lists public safety, transportation, accountability, business development, affordability and planning Lakeview&#39;s future. He says he will keep backing transit-oriented development, cut red tape and permit waits for small businesses, and require affordable units in every new development at the developer&#39;s expense.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>44th Ward alderman since 2023; chief of staff to former Ald. Tom Tunney for nearly 15 years.</p>
